sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant F as Frontend
  participant A as Supabase Auth
  participant DB as Supabase/Postgres

  U->>F: Open account page, click Edit
  F->>A: supabase.auth.getUser() (fetch session)
  A-->>F: user object
  U->>F: Submit updated fields (full_name, phone, address)
  F->>A: supabase.auth.updateUser({ data:{ full_name, phone, address } })
  A-->>F: 200 OK (auth metadata updated)
  alt also persist to profiles table
    F->>DB: upsert profiles {id:user.id, full_name, phone, address}
    DB-->>F: OK
  end
  F-->>U: show success message
